e><lpage>8</lpage><comment>Epub 2008 Apr 24</comment><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18439725</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b18-cln64_4p295"><label>18</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Suffoletto</surname><given-names>BP</given-names></name><name><surname>Cannon</surname><given-names>EH</given-names></name><name><surname>Ilkhanipour</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Yealy</surname><given-names>DM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Prevalence of S. aureus nasal colonization in Emergence Department Personnel</article-title><source>Ann Emerg Med</source><year>2008</year><volume>52</volume><issue>5</issue><fpage>529</fpage><lpage>33</lpage><comment>Epub 2008 Apr 24</comment><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18439722</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b19-cln64_4p295"><label>19</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Johnston</surname><given-names>CP</given-names></name><name><surname>Stokes</surname><given-names>AK</given-names></name><name><surname>Ross</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Cai</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Carroll</surname><given-names>KC</given-names></name><name><surname>Cosgrove</surname><given-names>SE</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>S. aureus colonization among healthcare workers at a tertiary care hospital</article-title><source>Infect Control Hosp Epidemiol</source><year>2007</year><volume>28</volume><issue>12</issue><fpage>1404</fpage><lpage>7</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17994523</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b20-cln64_4p295"><label>20</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Prado</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>S. aureus e S. aureus meticilina resistentes (MRSA) em profissionais da sa&#x000fa;de e as interfaces c